# /opt/ottimo-static/.env – secondary static site (infra/static, runbook infra/server/README.md section 14).
# Copy to the server with `install -o root -g ottimo -m 0640` (README 14.1), fill in. Only root writes it: it decides
# which names the edge routes. NO secret in this file (none is needed). Never commit the real file.
# Both names together or none (empty = the site is not routed); STATIC_WWW_HOST must be www.<STATIC_HOST>; one name per
# variable; names that are or end in ottimo.vn (or an OTTIMO stack's apex) are refused by edge.sh.
STATIC_HOST=example.test
STATIC_WWW_HOST=www.example.test
# ACME account contact (certificate expiry notices) – an address of the site's owner.
ACME_EMAIL=ops@example.test
# Web root on the host (read-only in the container, files must be readable by uid 10001: dirs 0755, files 0644).
STATIC_ROOT=/opt/ottimo-static/site
